<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SOS Staffing started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SOS Staffing started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber confirmed it initiated coverage of SOS Staffing Services Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it set a 1997 earnings estimate of $0.75 a share.</p>
<p>-- SOS Staffing gained 1 to 11-3/4 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
